<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Michael_Jackson>	<http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract>	"Amhr\u00E1na\u00ED, ceolt\u00F3ir agus cumad\u00F3ir a bh\u00ED i Michael Joseph Jackson (a rugadh i nGary, Indiana ar an 29 L\u00FAnasa 1958 agus a cailleadh i Los Angeles ar an 25 Meitheamh 2009). Thugta\u00ED \"R\u00ED an Phopcheoil\" air le fada, agus \u00E1ir\u00EDtear ar na heala\u00EDont\u00F3ir\u00ED popchult\u00FAir is m\u00F3 ratha, r\u00E1chairte agus tionchair \u00E9. D'fh\u00E1g s\u00E9 a lorg ar an bhfaisean agus ar an damhsa chomh maith. Ach bh\u00ED a shaol pr\u00EDobh\u00E1ideach f\u00E9in i mb\u00E9al an phobail ar feadh breis is dh\u00E1 sc\u00F3r bliain, an gr\u00E9as\u00E1n caidreamh a bh\u00ED aige le buachaill\u00ED \u00F3ga go m\u00F3r m\u00F3r."@ga .
